{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"irc-solo-r0--gemma31","runHash":"ac5214c2","audio":"../../audio/narration/irc-solo-r0--gemma31.16f97ba8.mp3","audioBytes":222672,"durationMs":74102,"runEndMs":41894,"timeMap":[[0,0],[27053,27053],[28553,30287],[30244,31978],[41528,31978],[41878,31988],[42578,31988],[46686,36096],[48186,39588],[48586,39988],[53743,39988],[56620,41594],[56970,41894],[74102,41894]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7140,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Gemma 4 31B agent this time, with a shared chat channel on the side."},{"audioMs":7490,"endMs":10574,"runMs":7490,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10924,"endMs":15497,"runMs":10924,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15847,"endMs":19403,"runMs":15847,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the channel?"},{"audioMs":30944,"endMs":34895,"runMs":31978,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 27 steps."},{"audioMs":35245,"endMs":36694,"runMs":31978,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":37044,"endMs":41528,"runMs":31978,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":42578,"endMs":43986,"runMs":31988,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":48586,"endMs":53393,"runMs":39988,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":53743,"endMs":56620,"runMs":39988,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":56970,"endMs":63917,"runMs":41894,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":64267,"endMs":69102,"runMs":41894,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":69452,"endMs":70595,"runMs":41894,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":70945,"endMs":71902,"runMs":41894,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
